-
 - [x] VERIFIED — checked with tool evidence (cite the specific tool call and output)
 - [?] UNVERIFIABLE — cannot be checked (document the specific blocker)
 - [ ] UNCHECKED — not yet verified (these are FAILURES, not unknowns)

 ### Step 2: Count
-
