-| Field                | Wire Value                          | Meaning |
-|----------------------|-------------------------------------|---------|
-| producer             | `rf-qa`                             | The rf-qa agent invoked under `QA_MODE: task-integrity` (see A.10). Writes the producer artifact to `${TASK_DIR}qa/qa-task-validation-report.md`. |
